sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Fan
  participant GW as CloudFront + WAF -> API Gateway (JWT) -> internal ALB
  participant WR as waiting-room service
  participant Q as SQS FIFO join-queue
  participant QM as queue-manager (Scheduler, 1 min)
  participant D as DynamoDB live-queue
  participant CO as checkout service
  participant DB as RDS PostgreSQL
  participant T as SNS order-events -> SQS ticket-queue
  participant TF as ticket-fn
  participant AWS as S3 tickets/ + Cognito + SES

  Fan->>GW: POST /api/waiting-room/{concert}/join
  GW->>WR: verified access token (ALB path rule)
  WR->>Q: SendMessage (group = concertId, dedup = hash(user, concert))
  WR-->>Fan: 202 pending
  QM->>Q: receive joins in arrival order
  QM->>D: assign position (WAITING)
  loop every 5 s
    Fan->>WR: GET /status (via gateway)
    WR->>D: GetItem
    WR-->>Fan: waiting, peopleAhead
  end
  QM->>D: admit next 500 per concert (ADMITTED, 15-min expiry)
  Fan->>CO: POST /api/checkout/holds (seatIds, via gateway)
  CO->>D: isAdmitted? (GetItem)
  alt not admitted
    CO-->>Fan: 403 not_admitted
  else admitted
    CO->>DB: one transaction: UPDATE seats (available or expired hold), insert pending order
    alt every seat updated
      CO-->>Fan: hold created, expires in 10 min
    else any seat taken
      CO-->>Fan: 409 seats_unavailable (nothing held)
    end
  end
  Fan->>CO: POST /holds/{id}/confirm (simulated payment)
  CO->>DB: seats held -> sold, order confirmed (one transaction)
  CO->>T: publish OrderConfirmed
  CO-->>Fan: 200 confirmed
  T->>TF: SQS batch (partial batch failures, DLQ after 5)
  TF->>AWS: HeadObject tickets/{orderId}.sent (exists: skip)
  TF->>AWS: PutObject tickets/{orderId}.pdf
  TF->>AWS: Cognito AdminGetUser (fan email)
  TF->>AWS: SES SendEmail with PDF attached
  TF->>AWS: PutObject tickets/{orderId}.sent (after SES accepts)
  Fan->>GW: GET /api/me/tickets/{id}/download (account service)
  GW-->>Fan: pre-signed S3 URL (300 s)
